{"id":"becco","lemma":"becco","pos":"noun","rank":1886,"glosses":["beak (structure projecting from a bird's face)","beak (anything projecting or ending in a point like a beak)","a mouthpiece of a woodwind instrument"],"ipa":"/ˈbek.ko/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"becchi"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-Crunchy_Cloaky_Crackdown-becco.wav","examples":[{"text":"Chiudi il becco.","en":"Shut your mouth.","words":[{"g":"to close, to shut","l":"chiudere"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"I pellicani hanno il becco grande.","en":"Pelicans have large beaks.","words":[{"g":"the","l":"la"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"adult, grownup"}]},{"text":"Chiudi il becco, Tom.","en":"Shut your mouth, Tom.","words":[{"g":"to close, to shut","l":"chiudere"},{"g":"the"},null,null]},{"text":"Un pellicano riesce a contenere molti pesci nel suo becco.","en":"A pelican can fit a lot of fish in its beak.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"pelican"},{"g":"to manage","l":"riuscire"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to contain"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot","l":"molto"},{"g":"fish","l":"pesce"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"his, hers, its"},null]}]}